cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use quick_pp in your research, coursework, or subsurface workflows, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "quick_pp: Practical Open-Source Petrophysics, Special Core Analysis (SCAL), and Subsurface Machine Learning"
abstract: >-
  quick_pp is an open-source scientific Python package and full-stack workstation
  for deterministic and probabilistic petrophysical evaluation, Special Core Analysis (SCAL)
  and relative permeability modeling, multi-well Free Water Level (FWL) contact optimization,
  stratigraphic log normalization, core-log calibration and depth matching, static-to-dynamic
  geomodel log upscaling, and Physics-Informed Machine Learning (PIML).
type: software
